The structural identity of these two messages — issued six months apart, with the same behavior in between — reveals the apology as operational, not genuine. A genuine apology precedes change. An operational apology substitutes for it. Annie's apologies are the latter. They are psychologically sophisticated in that they are earnest-sounding and emotionally specific. But their function is to discharge the debt without paying it.

| *The weaponized apology is more dangerous than no apology at all.* |
